'''''Not Good With Farewells''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[In the Withering Wintry Night]].

==Steps==
# Go over everything with the group
# Return to the Goethe Grand Hotel and rest
# Go to bed
# Meet with the group
# Discuss future plans with Wildfire members

